        {site.name} ("<strong>the Service</strong>") is an AI software tool
        operated by <strong>{legalEntity.name}</strong>, a
        {legalEntity.type.toLowerCase()} owned by {legalEntity.owner} at
        {legalEntity.address} ("<strong>we</strong>", "<strong>us</strong>",
        "<strong>our</strong>"). By accessing {site.domain}, creating an
